    LLM: "Prioritize replacing high cards (10s, Face cards) immediately. Try to match ranks in columns to erase even high numbers.\n\nIf you draw a high card from the stock that matches a face-down card you suspect is there (or just for a chance), replace a face-down card to keep the match option open.\n\nWatch your opponents' layouts. If they have many face-up cards, the round will end soon; prioritize flipping your own face-down cards to avoid being caught with unknown penalties.",
